    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d23-a4">

                <pb facs="0158" n="34" xml:id="pg34"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 4 in No. 411.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Kasson to Baron
                            Haymerle</hi>.</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >United States Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Vienna</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1881-01-15"><hi rendition="#italic">January</hi> 15,
                        1881</date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left"><hi rendition="#italic">F. O.,</hi> 1,
                    70.]</seg></opener>
                <p>The undersigned, envoy extraordinary and minister plenipotentiary of the United
                    States of America, acknowledging the reception of the note from the imperial and
                    royal ministry of foreign affairs (II, 66, 7), dated January 8, 1881, and
                    returning thanks for the communication with its inclosure, herewith returns the
                    declaration of renunciation of American citizenship made by Marcus Cohn, and
                    begs to say that Mr. Evarts desired the information with a view to understand
                    the customary forms adopted in such cases by the Austro-Hungarian
                    Government.</p>
                <p>The undersigned avails himself of this occasion to renew, &amp;c.</p>
                <closer><signed>KASSON.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>His excellency Baron <hi rendition="#small-caps">Haymerle</hi>,<lb/><hi
                            rendition="#italic">Imperial and Royal Minister for Foreign Affairs,
                            &amp;c., &amp;c., &amp;c.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
